From ca2a5b245558cfc1a872c0289fb79aae6a30fe23 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vlad777442 <vefirst@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 13:44:41 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] replicavault: vault deletes on acting-set rank 1 (copy
 into meta namespace)

On the OSD at acting-set rank 1, a head delete is expanded in this OSD's own
local transaction into a copy of the object (data, xattrs, omap, checksum)
into coll_t::meta() namespace 'replicavault', followed by the unchanged remove.
Hooks: ReplicatedBackend::do_repop (live deletes) and
PrimaryLogPG::remove_missing_object (deletes learned through recovery).
The PG log, the shipped transaction, and all PG-collection ops are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GapZ5dvT4vTJ9FHbVNTeKb
